  "bodyHash": "8d1acda30d88144b",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>XPlus IMBlocker（XPlus Contingameime）</h1>\n<p>本作是 <a href=\"https://github.com/Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">IngameIME</a> 非官方版本的非官方续作，同时也是 <a href=\"https://github.com/ThinkingStudios/ContingameIME\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ContingameIME</a> 的非官方更新版本。</p>\n<p>支持在全屏 Minecraft 中使用输入法。</p>\n<h1>预览</h1>\n<h3>窗口模式</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i1.mcobj.com/imgb/u18prz/20240624_6678f0cc04449.gif\" alt=\"6c501fcda77c5e6619a75762bdb41e98c751a9e3.gif\"></p>\n<h3>全屏模式</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i1.mcobj.com/imgb/u18prz/20240624_6678f0cc6d87a.webp\" alt=\"1e2b0a16e2e2ef1338507579d969690340ec8c26.webp\"></p>\n<h1>切换键</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>单击热键可在 <strong>临时输入状态</strong> 与 <strong>关闭状态</strong> 之间切换</li>\n<li>双击热键可切换到 <strong>开启模式</strong></li>\n<li>当鼠标移动且输入内容已确认时，<strong>临时输入状态</strong> 将自动切换至 <strong>关闭状态</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<p><strong>Forge</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin for Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Fabric</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/satin-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satin API</a> <strong>（可选，与 OptiFine 冲突）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>本模组运行需要 VCRuntime141，请前往微软官网下载：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flearn.microsoft.com%252fen-US%252fcpp%252fwindows%252flatest-supported-vc-redist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载链接</a></h3>\n<h1>本模组代码参考/使用来源</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Xieecao/C2GIME\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xieecao/C2GIME</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThinkingStudios/ContingameIME\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ThinkingStudios/ContingameIME</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n</ul>",
